msgid "Bricks Builder"
msgstr "Bricks Builder"

#: src/Admin/IntegrationReadiness.php:21
msgid ""
"Bricks integration is optional. Likes works without a page builder and "
"enables its Bricks adapter automatically when Bricks is active."
msgstr ""
"De Bricks-integratie is optioneel. Likes werkt zonder page builder en "
"schakelt de Bricks-adapter automatisch in wanneer Bricks actief is."

#: src/Admin/FrontendSetup.php:14
msgid ""
"Bricks is optional. When active, Likes exposes builder-native data and "
"interaction contracts without moving reaction logic into the builder."
msgstr ""
"Bricks is optioneel. Wanneer het actief is, stelt Likes builder-native data-"
" en interactiecontracten beschikbaar zonder reactielogica naar de builder te"
" verplaatsen."

#: src/Admin/IconField.php:32
msgid "Choose from the bundled icon set. No external icon library is loaded."
msgstr ""
"Kies uit de meegeleverde iconenset. Er wordt geen externe iconenbibliotheek "
"geladen."

#: src/Admin/PostTypeSettings.php:20
msgid ""
"Choose which public post types may receive reactions. Expand a row only when"
" that post type needs its own presentation or visibility rules."
msgstr ""
"Kies welke publieke berichttypen reacties mogen ontvangen. Klap een rij "
"alleen uit wanneer dat berichttype eigen presentatie- of "
"zichtbaarheidsregels nodig heeft."

